Level 2 - Task 1 — Environment Variables & Secrets   - 5/7/2026
-----------------------------------------------------------

3 tarah ke variables hote hain:

1) Hardcoded env variable — workflow file me hi define karo
   env:
     APP_NAME: "MyApp"
   Use: $APP_NAME

2) GitHub Repository Variables — Settings me store karo
   Use: ${{ vars.MY_VAR }}
   Kab: Non-sensitive config jo change ho sakti hai

3) GitHub Secrets — Sensitive data, logs me *** dikhta hai
   Use: ${{ secrets.MY_SECRET }}
   Kab: Passwords, API keys, tokens

env: 3 levels pe use kar sakte ho:
- Workflow level → sab jobs me available
- Job level → sirf us job me
- Step level → sirf us step me

Key Rule: Secret print nahi karte — directly command me use karte hain!
  ❌ echo "${{ secrets.PASSWORD }}"
  ✅ docker login -p ${{ secrets.PASSWORD }}







