Level 2 - Task 3 — Matrix Strategy
-----------------------------------------------------------

Run same job across multiple configurations in parallel.

strategy:
  matrix:
    python: ["3.10", "3.11", "3.12"]
    os: [ubuntu-latest, windows-latest]

Total jobs = 3 versions × 2 OS = 6 parallel jobs!

Key points:
- runs-on: ${{ matrix.os }} → dynamic OS
- python-version: ${{ matrix.python }} → dynamic version
- actions/checkout@v4 → clones repo on fresh runner
- actions/setup-python@v4 → installs python on runner










